The file today is federal. Federal support for grid expansion has to be worked into environmental

00:01:48.310 --> 00:01:54.050
assessment scoping for transmission projects. When cumulative effects on habitat and species at

00:01:54.050 --> 00:01:59.850
risk are on the table. Confirm the application actually cites the new funding streams. Monitoring

00:01:59.850 --> 00:02:04.950
expectations for grid-related effluent or emissions may shift once connection plans are

00:02:04.950 --> 00:02:09.990
written down. The reported analysis puts the upgrade need in the billions of dollars for

00:02:09.990 --> 00:02:15.530
grids that are already out of date. Those steep costs could hold back further renewable installations,

00:02:15.910 --> 00:02:20.630
which is the trade an assessment has to show when infrastructure need meets environmental limits.

